      it; the verifier reproduced the vanishing dialog live before the fix. A dismissed ask now stops
      listening. Third, ALTITUDE: the result's per-suite count said 18 where the file runs 22, because a
      test.each block yields more cases than it has test( calls. Fourth, ALTITUDE: the test/v2 and doc/v1
      notes sat on the pre-fix commit, so the tip the gate would read carried none. One refutation was NOT
      accepted, and the reason is on the record: a finder said exportHar threw a status-shaped message where
      the other two doors throw the server's sentence, and its verifier refuted it partly on the strength of
      THIS WU's own plan. A plan does not outrank the design it cites - run 11's Interaction table says any
